# ─── Dukaan WhatsApp backend ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Copy to .env and fill in. Never commit .env.
#
# ⚠️  Precedence: the process environment wins over this file (dotenv's default).
#     A test pins a variable, a shell export sets it, a platform injects it — all of
#     those beat .env. So an exported variable shadows this file, and an exported
#     EMPTY variable blanks a real value in it. Keep a key you are not using
#     commented out rather than present-with-no-value, as this file does.

# ── AI engines (at least one) ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# GROQ_API_KEY=
# GROQ_MODEL=
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY=
# OPENROUTER_MODEL=
# Local SLM fallback (optional)
# Only uncomment this if a local model server is actually running. While it is set
# and unreachable, every message the cloud providers fail costs a full 8s abort
# (see localSlm.js); with it absent the fallback is skipped outright.
# LLM_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8080/v1/chat/completions
# LLM_MODEL_NAME=

# ── Supabase (multi-shop routing) ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# With these set, the bot matches the nearest shop from business_profiles and
# orders only from that owner's products, then mirrors the order into `orders`.
# Use the SERVICE ROLE key (Project Settings → API). It is server-side only and
# must never be shipped to the browser: the POS app's VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY is
# NOT usable here because the project's RLS has no anon policies on
# business_profiles / products / orders, so an anon key reads nothing.
# SUPABASE_URL=
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_KEY=eyJ...

# ── Dev / single-shop fallback ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Used ONLY when Supabase is not configured: the one local shop, owned by this
# account. With Supabase configured this is ignored (owner comes from the shop).
# Without it (and without SUPABASE_SERVICE_KEY) the bot refuses every order and
# logs why — it never writes an ownerless order.
# DUKAN_DEFAULT_OWNER_ID=

# ── Delivery radius ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# A shop farther than this from the customer's pin does not serve them, and the
# bot places no order. Default 5 km.
DUKAN_MAX_DELIVERY_KM=5
